Package: LineaLinkR
Type: Package
Title: Lineage and Cell-Cell Communication Integration
Version: 0.6.8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: data.table, Matrix, RANN, stats, tools, igraph, RSpectra,
        matrixStats
LinkingTo: RcppEigen
Author: Hongjie Jiang [aut], Xinyu Zhang [aut], Hong Xin Wang [aut],
    Yanxiao Han [aut], Yanshuo Han [aut, cre]
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hongjie", "Jiang", role = "aut"),
    person("Xinyu", "Zhang", role = "aut"),
    person("Hong Xin", "Wang", role = "aut"),
    person("Yanxiao", "Han", email = "yanxiao.han@aliyun.com", role = "aut"),
    person("Yanshuo", "Han", email = "yanshuohan@dlut.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Infers RNA-state trajectories and lineage memberships from
    cell-neighbour graphs and estimates sample-matched ligand-receptor
    activity contrasts across related states. Includes temporal profiles,
    sender-removal queries and conditional lineage-composition estimates.
